    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just that... even when I \"rest,\" it doesn't feel like a break. it just feels like waiting. waiting for the pain to get worse, waiting for more things to break. i look at my meds and my walkers and i just feel like a burden. like i'm just lingering around until I'm gone anyway. it feels so much more dignified to just be gone than to just fade away like this.",
