    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to see how they'd end together, you know? everything just feels so out of my hands. i'm just sitting here watching myself crumble, waiting for some inevitable moment to take me. it feels so pathetic, just letting things happen to you. wouldn't it be better to just have a say in it? to choose when the waiting is over?",
